        <summary>Is Hashi free on GridPaw?</summary>
        <p>Yes, completely free. The GridPaw Hashi puzzle runs in your browser with no download, no account and no payment. Pick Easy 8x8, Medium 10x10 or Hard 12x12 and start building bridges immediately.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do Hashi puzzles require guessing?</summary>
        <p>No. Every well-formed Hashiwokakero puzzle, including every board on GridPaw, has a unique solution reachable through pure logical deduction. If you feel stuck, return to the corners and the degree-1 islands; there is always a clue you have not counted yet.</p>
